  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-16T07:34:32.605Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In Quest, you can see objects flicker everywhere when turning Forced Camera Near Distance On, even \"Dynamic mode\", which is considered to be have fewer problems will happen. \nPerhaps, this situation is caused by Quest's less accurate Z-buffer, so, Near-Clip may have to be set more farther from camera in Quest platform. \nI think \"Forced mode\" needs no change, despite they cause more problems, because it alerts users about grafic artifacts will be happening.",
